2. Create a service account and download the JSON key file. You can follow the instructions in the [Google Cloud documentation](https://cloud.google.com/iam/docs/creating-managing-service-accounts).

3. Install the Google API client library for JavaScript by running `npm install googleapis` in your project directory.

